    <item>
      <title>Semantic Search</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/project/semantic_search/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 10 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/project/semantic_search/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;project-objective&#34;&gt;Project Objective&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The objective of this project was to train a visual imitation learning agent for a robotic pouring task, and validate the performance in both simulated and real environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&#34;research-supervisor&#34;&gt;Research Supervisor&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.linkedin.com/in/yasin-yaz%C4%B1c%C4%B1o%C4%9Flu-2a6475203/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Yasin Yazicioglu&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
