&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.linkedin.com/in/amin-kashiri/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Amin Kashiri&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;abstract&#34;&gt;Abstract&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The objective of this project was to train a visual imitation learning agent for a robotic pouring task, and validate the performance in both simulated and real environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;!-- ## Demo Video



    
    &lt;div style=&#34;position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden;&#34;&gt;
      &lt;iframe allow=&#34;accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share&#34; allowfullscreen=&#34;allowfullscreen&#34; loading=&#34;eager&#34; referrerpolicy=&#34;strict-origin-when-cross-origin&#34; src=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/embed/LCxA5zYdCbA?autoplay=0&amp;controls=1&amp;end=0&amp;loop=0&amp;mute=0&amp;start=0&#34; style=&#34;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border:0;&#34; title=&#34;YouTube video&#34;
